{"media_id": 3693099154004353659, "shortcode": "DNAhh0auaJ7", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DNAhh0auaJ7/", "taken_at": "2025-08-06T09:19:53", "caption": "一个人的夜？\n\n \n\n#couple #reels #reelsinstagram #comedy #relationships", "owner_username": "helin_and_eva", "owner_id": "73788393441", "likes": 151658, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0001_DNAhh0auaJ7\\DNAhh0auaJ7_20250806_091953.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18050189180631149, "text": "兄弟 你值得好的 但又不是這麼好的", "created_at": "2025-08-08T14:21:35", "owner": "lee0885269", "likes": 49943}, {"id": 17861845842465802, "text": "女的很漂亮 男的有穿衣服", "created_at": "2025-08-29T17:11:25", "owner": "tin.g52013", "likes": 531}, {"id": 18073860529849195, "text": "原本在想鏡子的紅點是幹嘛的，原來是我的鼻子掉在那了", "created_at": "2025-08-29T10:04:49", "owner": "nick.1209_studying", "likes": 4357}, {"id": 18055368425528249, "text": "現在知道賺錢的重要性了吧", "created_at": "2025-08-08T12:59:10", "owner": "hsu0517_", "likes": 7005}, {"id": 18073863737070768, "text": "不是 哥們 精靈公主 怎麼做到的 求救學", "created_at": "2025-08-09T11:06:38", "owner": "a.lie.z", "likes": 4700}, {"id": 18091909444732997, "text": "那个微笑是要杀死谁！姐姐超好看！😍", "created_at": "2025-08-14T13:22:33", "owner": "puiru21_", "likes": 82}, {"id": 18260173762304971, "text": "你可以過得好但不能比我更好", "created_at": "2025-08-09T07:01:49", "owner": "rjie1.9", "likes": 4694}, {"id": 18075927287502363, "text": "我怕兄弟過的苦 又怕兄弟開路虎", "created_at": "2025-08-14T05:55:34", "owner": "huaichungfeng", "likes": 628}, {"id": 18070758607944292, "text": "太美了 我都愛上了", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:00:29", "owner": "ruizhen5288", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18074824943514259, "text": "女生長得很漂亮，男生是個人類", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:12:46", "owner": "chainsaw.0922", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18051910076560462, "text": "兄弟影片好好拍，沒帶這樣傷人的😢", "created_at": "2025-10-04T18:02:06", "owner": "wu_xiu_du", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18065219528263761, "text": "女生很漂亮 男生也有穿衣服", "created_at": "2025-09-11T11:33:40", "owner": "higashi23_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18067532026912580, "text": "單身的我為了脫單在找穿搭，來了一個不穿不搭的人牽一個金髮碧眼長腿大美女在店裡秀恩愛，誰不破防？？", "created_at": "2025-08-11T02:14:13", "owner": "yaaabijay", "likes": 813}, {"id": 18127624063459630, "text": "现在大家都知道 为什么哥布林这么爱金币，也知道哥布林可以驯服精灵了吧？", "created_at": "2025-08-19T04:31:52", "owner": "magnusmcginnis", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18073050182090101, "text": "無聊 假視頻", "created_at": "2025-08-12T18:49:07", "owner": "notkj__", "likes": 307}, {"id": 18036384257691801, "text": "奇怪我怎麼拿著手機一小時了\n我是誰我在幹嘛", "created_at": "2025-08-28T11:23:52", "owner": "lan_ouo_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18020711375546697, "text": "請問那些紅色圓形是免費提供的嗎 這裡有需要🤡", "created_at": "2025-08-12T02:19:30", "owner": "xing20111", "likes": 324}, {"id": 18030130241549179, "text": "各位午安除了你們兩個", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:35:29", "owner": "wcz._.lizn0", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18051836972196444, "text": "好了，哥布林們！看完跟我回山洞了", "created_at": "2025-08-09T00:03:51", "owner": "mlb_.17", "likes": 175}, {"id": 18026823794739720, "text": "上下身基礎 配飾就不基礎了", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:36:24", "owner": "gingerlemoncola", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18042508682652843, "text": "Bro envied by 1 billion people", "created_at": "2025-08-06T11:16:29", "owner": "mark_vong", "likes": 367}, {"id": 18044505122695255, "text": "兄弟呀你是值得好的但是你应该也不至于值得最好的吧", "created_at": "2025-11-06T03:38:01", "owner": "emo89891", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18128242543466539, "text": "哥布林看完記得回洞窟", "created_at": "2025-09-02T09:15:44", "owner": "mj_.2020", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18177449584351061, "text": "不是？", "created_at": "2025-10-01T01:52:43", "owner": "georgia_evangeline", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954505386863305, "text": "也太好看", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:42:43", "owner": "srr1zy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18285635902263493, "text": "她一个大坐bro就得短尾逃生", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:04:31", "owner": "bowen_weil", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17862649437507619, "text": "怎麼看美女前面還有一段廣告", "created_at": "2025-10-26T10:38:40", "owner": "sjrqs_4f", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17864506707517201, "text": "原本覺得你挺可憐，結果可憐的是我", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:33:26", "owner": "master.chia.8888", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17898690954276963, "text": "男生基礎 女生就不基礎", "created_at": "2025-09-15T10:57:00", "owner": "___abby___", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18080312545911738, "text": "你過太好了", "created_at": "2025-08-15T04:12:26", "owner": "elite.09.15", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056178593410583, "text": "憑什麼", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:50:11", "owner": "oni.tattoo.tw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073008986604874, "text": "@zzl._.418 管弦指揮", "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:22:21", "owner": "jisoo.0103.jisoo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927503221141895, "text": "淦為什麼又刷到\n再罵一次 淦\n過分了兄弟", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:29:51", "owner": "cck.zhang", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18056777012540119, "text": "好扯 漂亮到很不真實", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:25:15", "owner": "anna721175", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17919563037112609, "text": "果然男人最好的裝飾品就是漂亮的女伴", "created_at": "2025-08-13T20:19:54", "owner": "penguin0000_", "likes": 348}, {"id": 18068280005516283, "text": "我覺得你們不可以在公共場合這樣........算了我找人弄你", "created_at": "2025-08-31T14:35:51", "owner": "chen._.zer", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18071211425373480, "text": "@prvvfenn @kqi_11o", "created_at": "2025-12-17T09:26:59", "owner": "gz12345.98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076750396805321, "text": "哥們！你該健身\n這樣都hold 不了", "created_at": "2025-08-21T09:40:10", "owner": "bgualchen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071589275034530, "text": "大家生活要開心喔！\n除了你們兩個，除了是動詞", "created_at": "2025-08-19T07:44:51", "owner": "cudo_vis", "likes": 1412}, {"id": 18040373954372215, "text": "你在公共場合這樣拍不太好，會打擾到別人", "created_at": "2025-08-12T09:45:06", "owner": "shang_yang11111", "likes": 2108}, {"id": 17924506284188722, "text": "我鄭重的\n希望作者可以刪掉，我朋友被打擊到了\n絕對不是我，是我朋友", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:40:30", "owner": "cicarr1009", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17908007628254924, "text": "不知道輸在哪嗎？看一下那女生的包就懂了", "created_at": "2025-10-24T12:40:44", "owner": "sea._aurora", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073540223017301, "text": "原來看妹子 需要先看廣告", "created_at": "2025-08-21T09:44:46", "owner": "tin10.29", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18100167427570521, "text": "女的好漂亮，男的长的像个男的", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:36:12", "owner": "miandao0705", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17925322275187069, "text": "老婆是哪里人？", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:48:46", "owner": "wolong747", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18013157120773027, "text": "看到玻璃上的紅點了嗎，對，那是我的鼻子", "created_at": "2025-08-13T08:17:45", "owner": "monkey._.09_15", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085858094509141, "text": "你 只用單手🙋", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:27:44", "owner": "zcx_9420", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18061357544568748, "text": "我可以愛上你......女朋友嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:20:56", "owner": "renlei747", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17938420622935478, "text": "香奈兒", "created_at": "2025-08-17T23:35:48", "owner": "_xin_.99", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18040840751654748, "text": "@ching1022", "created_at": "2025-08-12T08:17:02", "owner": "curnforhome", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065143837980937, "text": "@hsujenkai", "created_at": "2025-08-13T13:43:38", "owner": "condenses_art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859068895470479, "text": "輸光", "created_at": "2025-08-14T16:33:05", "owner": "ven.poler", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891969403183409, "text": "兄弟 你值得好的 但又不是這麼好的", "created_at": "2025-08-29T15:38:47", "owner": "bha_3007", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079622464993741, "text": "我破防了", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:01:45", "owner": "lucky_8989day", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869927863379001, "text": "女伴沒有抱好。失敗", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:05:01", "owner": "u0u0are", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17935587443966325, "text": "憑什麼啊", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:59:59", "owner": "anan.cc__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079746314072310, "text": "超猛", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:57:32", "owner": "wkd1689", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121367491453596, "text": "这一定是AI", "created_at": "2025-10-02T19:41:21", "owner": "nolan.fffff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088041718869637, "text": "說你值得更好 沒說值得這麼好", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:55:26", "owner": "1urzy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052864049540774, "text": "這廣告也太長了吧", "created_at": "2025-08-13T11:30:09", "owner": "hsu_.28", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069937412217082, "text": "有秘笈嗎🥹這麼漂亮的姐姐哪裡找啦💦", "created_at": "2025-10-07T11:29:31", "owner": "c._.qn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076174241050274, "text": "操", "created_at": "2025-08-29T03:52:21", "owner": "imshawn76", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18003860666819848, "text": "喔 嚇到 還以為是霸軒", "created_at": "2025-10-03T14:36:13", "owner": "i_love_jaehyun.1204", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17894527536293417, "text": "。。。", "created_at": "2025-08-20T16:48:44", "owner": "pracsoc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084585745807052, "text": "不要搞拐賣", "created_at": "2025-08-28T04:55:56", "owner": "hugo1010416", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103354366533005, "text": "突然想複習美女與野獸了", "created_at": "2025-10-03T07:57:01", "owner": "koushiixx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990350505701638, "text": "我的天啊", "created_at": "2025-08-13T13:11:23", "owner": "ko_boung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105882343583540, "text": "我覺得男的長得也蠻好看的啊", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:26:50", "owner": "do._.not._.regret", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038794562475597, "text": "最後連扶都扶不好，可見兄弟的口袋才是實力", "created_at": "2025-09-22T18:13:19", "owner": "shiumo100", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18372609163149280, "text": "兄弟，如果頂不住是可以換人的", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:34:19", "owner": "adiroyder", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18029039009711827, "text": "先看那個女生手上拿什麼包包🤞🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:37:03", "owner": "yps_4414", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18522155434065236, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:16:28", "owner": "pei__hao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064852598361993, "text": "@chiupin.0120 我兄弟跟紅髮女約會", "created_at": "2025-09-18T01:00:39", "owner": "urtheworstttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401480128191174, "text": "女生很漂亮 男生也有穿衣服", "created_at": "2025-08-30T22:40:36", "owner": "xu_ringring", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18528063877007868, "text": "@goodruoruo", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:53:41", "owner": "e23450", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071309566922541, "text": "UNIQLO也能出大片", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:30:45", "owner": "yu_hao012", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078817663809415, "text": "好纖細好漂亮呀 又有動力減肥了", "created_at": "2025-09-13T17:06:46", "owner": "yunjxbx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068662511233927, "text": "這面鏡子在哪裡買？", "created_at": "2025-09-12T14:10:41", "owner": "_masa0920", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17875112679410611, "text": "兄弟我為你感到...幹", "created_at": "2025-09-13T03:18:26", "owner": "tyler_and_27", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065746031195834, "text": "大家都單身好好的，你沒事整一個外國妹子怎麼搞？ 退回去！ 快給我退回去啊～～", "created_at": "2025-08-15T09:09:36", "owner": "howe_living", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17865307749440381, "text": "你們的快樂妨礙到我了", "created_at": "2025-08-15T08:03:22", "owner": "stu81126", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18019165688585639, "text": "本來想tag 但我沒對象..", "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:13:46", "owner": "nierh_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17918118762035649, "text": "她殺人被你看到了？", "created_at": "2025-09-02T10:18:01", "owner": "223.cyhhhouzi_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080789056759570, "text": "还说啥 跳了兄弟", "created_at": "2025-09-10T16:17:22", "owner": "zhuoxxueee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992067024828365, "text": "前兩秒 三小？\n後面…….你贏！", "created_at": "2025-09-11T06:59:01", "owner": "shashi_lin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18202177561309787, "text": "忌妒使人面目全非", "created_at": "2025-09-11T11:04:44", "owner": "shihsianyan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041393438398647, "text": "不是啊哥們，你穿這樣跟他出門約會太不尊重女生了吧！即便你有鈔能力也不能這樣啊！", "created_at": "2025-09-11T13:43:46", "owner": "aaron.rain", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056219348164747, "text": "快了 中國開放俄爹免簽了！", "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:56:56", "owner": "kairikuo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107492110493153, "text": "有錢人終成眷屬，沒錢人親眼目睹", "created_at": "2025-09-03T07:30:46", "owner": "ouo_777_777", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18338894269166119, "text": "憑什麼⋯", "created_at": "2025-09-05T07:23:34", "owner": "wawa.yujj", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17857247229490588, "text": "拜託告訴我那個女的是男的", "created_at": "2025-08-26T17:48:25", "owner": "hua.pen", "likes": 43}, {"id": 18169040533317784, "text": "我以為是展示衣服的模特兒😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T20:09:23", "owner": "777.u_n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865545640450831, "text": "AI功能现在已经如此逼真了吗", "created_at": "2025-08-31T20:20:10", "owner": "unique_dong_dong", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18289369402262719, "text": "憑什麼？", "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:24:33", "owner": "tomosa.tw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18163898362358771, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-20T14:54:36", "owner": "fei_wu_043", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993673206728592, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-20T11:06:23", "owner": "zoecheng1205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962584849006717, "text": "我以為他要蹲下去 結果原來小丑是我🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-20T11:02:18", "owner": "dgjndsjknch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054461093669574, "text": "只有我看到外面有yonex嗎", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:48:20", "owner": "mak_tsz2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977943921793567, "text": "兄弟不是我要說你短褲是不能穿好嗎為什麼要歪歪", "created_at": "2025-12-18T18:06:09", "owner": "gootyu_dhb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107041240724186, "text": "@he.711_", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:07:41", "owner": "wei._0310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068047055383492, "text": "兄弟沒這個必要吧，眼紅了", "created_at": "2025-12-16T09:57:00", "owner": "tt.pp.abc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089324143799809, "text": "我到底輸在哪裡啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！！！😢", "created_at": "2025-12-15T13:28:18", "owner": "robloxfruitgood9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075837395462736, "text": "@_jhao.z 。", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:43:12", "owner": "chancey0712", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918191617214277, "text": "看到那個紅紅的了嗎？誰幫我撿鼻子🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:52:11", "owner": "lllu117_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172970869327407, "text": "現在的AI做的真逼真 差點要破防", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:24:58", "owner": "justpaper___1002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104204584729700, "text": "看個哀居把自己看破防了", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:18:16", "owner": "eric__chi2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539152261046887, "text": "我的鼻子已經在鏡子上了", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:41:58", "owner": "323love_vv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860653915486624, "text": "？", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:05:17", "owner": "doo_oiiia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919141564076060, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:01:47", "owner": "ryan_kyaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077613371188500, "text": "哥我覺得她更喜歡女生所以讓我來吧😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:10:57", "owner": "zaizai8a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552845512031548, "text": "贏麻了", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:07:08", "owner": "john.han.shin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136443148475944, "text": "Wuaaaahhhh", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:17:13", "owner": "mhd.eko20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847606453584808, "text": "欸？欸？我沒有預期到是這樣的結局！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:29:11", "owner": "cydneyno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867908419490855, "text": "破防", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:05:59", "owner": "playi622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914879044246669, "text": "人生勝利組👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:55:20", "owner": "lin_width", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929743645016427, "text": "好羨慕啊啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:18:05", "owner": "adhd.da", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852894268586493, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:13:44", "owner": "hlencass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086111758955372, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:58:51", "owner": "ak_ash_sohan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190065634339751, "text": "哪裡簽的 給我來一個", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:54:56", "owner": "0707_yueyue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066898589120241, "text": "誰准許你在Uniqlo抓妖精了", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:54:55", "owner": "jlucasu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058233308285854, "text": "看懂了 学不会", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:44:38", "owner": "yallah_avecpete", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076441850182752, "text": "好邋遢", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:40:16", "owner": "sheyl_lll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081500588112838, "text": "為什麼為什麼為什麼為什麼為什麼", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:25:02", "owner": "se_2189", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026506454771443, "text": "过分！", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:43:56", "owner": "serentipity.q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304344772269287, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😍😍😍😍❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:07:09", "owner": "chef_hamada44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308292334248969, "text": "娶進家門了嗎？ 可以改善家族基因，應該會。 以後的後代子孫會身材高挑手腳碩長。", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:19:25", "owner": "kennethhuang1914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106822024722872, "text": "CUTE", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:08:04", "owner": "notestes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104577277729276, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:36:37", "owner": "itsaydk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844538689616592, "text": "?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:09:56", "owner": "zhao_free11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111860131601429, "text": "閃瞎眼睛了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:57:34", "owner": "pjpj520520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996741192705626, "text": "那还说啥了，我先跳了兄弟们", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:36:07", "owner": "qing_feng.ming_yue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032100581740625, "text": "兄弟 我知道你負擔會太大 要不我來吧", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:17:09", "owner": "jun_870423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977275458948377, "text": "你干嘛啊，你找不到对象我们又不是不会安慰你", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:19:26", "owner": "bigthunder972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911189407253240, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:30:09", "owner": "cwt_bane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086364391820726, "text": "你吃不消", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:29:21", "owner": "senx_0721", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063283892185442, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:43:40", "owner": "hanna_1030110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945667882080187, "text": "應該放個400才頂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:20:54", "owner": "mclaren._.6666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521072734066226, "text": "鈔能力", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:07:15", "owner": "takpotex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084965191996403, "text": "@ann__0111", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:59:59", "owner": "ww_0523", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067386983098734, "text": "爱了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:00:16", "owner": "ccwei183", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171324136371738, "text": "兄弟 你是真該死啊", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:27:52", "owner": "jeff1007_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032339447731598, "text": "你小子凭！什！么！", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:50:27", "owner": "cyq_zxy_912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040853003699447, "text": "皮諾可這個直接電死", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:55:48", "owner": "to_whats_up", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087528796989026, "text": "這影片讓我很自卑", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:15:31", "owner": "enlil996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088200857506085, "text": "不啊得（跌倒）", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:27:21", "owner": "_newjeansdiary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085582597956490, "text": "一個懂事一個董事", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:23:51", "owner": "1akanezz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542514856054481, "text": "兄弟respect 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-16T00:38:01", "owner": "tanzy1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993344313849531, "text": "女的很漂亮 男的有穿衣服👍", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:50:23", "owner": "o.sai.com.tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947101426063727, "text": "女的美若天仙，男的至少看著像個人", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:09:46", "owner": "wzdn0107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126688117450871, "text": "這是烏克蘭嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:22:11", "owner": "fg26787287", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884490511280227, "text": "這一定是ai", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:20:48", "owner": "a2387878", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845703937607573, "text": "ai", "created_at": "2025-11-12T08:00:55", "owner": "zjllllll9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901405675164454, "text": "(✪▽✪)", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:17:52", "owner": "diego308550", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107409238717413, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:17:37", "owner": "diego308550", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080064896033821, "text": "哥你真得教教我了", "created_at": "2025-11-11T00:52:06", "owner": "jay.99999_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010936451639698, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:03:44", "owner": "waynechong_4224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028339649551146, "text": "黃仁勳這個就是你想要的世界嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:34:23", "owner": "hao_92287", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038239793687867, "text": "哥們你可以過得更好 這個跟我吧", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:40:50", "owner": "know9._.17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082801964003661, "text": "这是优衣库吧？", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:57:07", "owner": "shiksuansu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537712027050306, "text": "女的超級正 男的也是男的", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:33:24", "owner": "yesyaya._.77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009566147811751, "text": "看得我后槽牙都咬碎了，八嘎呀路！🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:24:02", "owner": "cxl.2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898248337338274, "text": "祝你们幸福哦", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:51:13", "owner": "tess_yezi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898124254182350, "text": "凭什么", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:04:52", "owner": "ky_ee10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127102627498407, "text": "世の中money", "created_at": "2025-11-03T06:53:17", "owner": "mmhr_k.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064804928571253, "text": "好美", "created_at": "2025-11-03T04:10:22", "owner": "koh_shubi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072282857520367, "text": "99", "created_at": "2025-11-02T01:11:02", "owner": "fruit1722010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150993121373503, "text": "How did he pull her -", "created_at": "2025-11-01T16:36:13", "owner": "chickemc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848153119561136, "text": "姊妹我不好嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-01T16:23:21", "owner": "fish_tank_no_fish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065264813111849, "text": "짱깨?", "created_at": "2025-11-01T13:39:17", "owner": "1988sjn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972763746953486, "text": "破防", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:05:05", "owner": "haodekeyimeiguanxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023814011581270, "text": "哥們就是說介不介意把漂亮小姐姐送我👁️🫦👁️", "created_at": "2025-10-25T10:17:47", "owner": "do_.hyu3o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154347649400179, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:41:01", "owner": "sawt_safir_el_bolboli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863815348488629, "text": "这种女友哪里找😢", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:59:24", "owner": "allenzyr813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059589755440178, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:20:13", "owner": "_7nnvy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093224140832542, "text": "這在哪裡啊？", "created_at": "2025-10-20T09:17:18", "owner": "_.n.0412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904551490259438, "text": "卧槽凭什么", "created_at": "2025-10-17T08:30:41", "owner": "wushujiu99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083042902768545, "text": "兄弟 妳上輩子拯救過地球嗎", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:46:24", "owner": "frank776677", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108409039517405, "text": "簡直是人生勝利組 這女生簡直是仙女", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:30:00", "owner": "0316.1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926506546136500, "text": "兄弟！幹得好👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:40:48", "owner": "josh_chang_josh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957359616858872, "text": "我以為會牽個假人🆘(後面那隻", "created_at": "2025-10-05T17:00:22", "owner": "c_y030y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531876733010830, "text": "俄罗斯诚不欺我", "created_at": "2025-10-05T08:46:08", "owner": "17.92868910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964387887824829, "text": "📈", "created_at": "2025-10-05T05:45:54", "owner": "weiho_ng0426", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942626773061373, "text": "這裡是明曜百貨對吧", "created_at": "2025-10-04T17:26:26", "owner": "xin.99.325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896201173311891, "text": "看兄弟過得那麼好我就不好了😢", "created_at": "2025-10-04T00:24:54", "owner": "lululu2831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341746369207039, "text": "不喜歡這篇 因為我沒有", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:25:09", "owner": "yu._ji._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070512692236862, "text": "后面有间yonex喎🌝🏸", "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:09:04", "owner": "jie_jiahao_0827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078718049483038, "text": "抱歉檢舉了", "created_at": "2025-10-01T20:37:52", "owner": "lil_shortyalex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945295948048567, "text": "姐們這是妳爸嗎", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:13:55", "owner": "butterquakeioo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889587331352661, "text": "ai嗎", "created_at": "2025-10-01T17:28:09", "owner": "ka_chon_0805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114157525558217, "text": "@g20_hk_jmt  @theleostory  @_20siufung", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:57:20", "owner": "jjj.g20b48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059086139390566, "text": "輸了", "created_at": "2025-10-01T16:50:50", "owner": "liondog0809", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028646456524727, "text": "愛人如養花", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:32:09", "owner": "ting_.c7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077311664059735, "text": "請給我謝謝🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-01T13:02:41", "owner": "wowkie_dmnagi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295189576271283, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:25:36", "owner": "ethanchiang0526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054300971218030, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:57:06", "owner": "zirox__11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042865577400431, "text": "突然就笑不出来了", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:28:52", "owner": "real_dasakura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899977363278125, "text": "最後快撐不住好好笑", "created_at": "2025-09-25T06:33:35", "owner": "naraonoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021392606569911, "text": "超正❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:15:29", "owner": "cousin_aunt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888388963358596, "text": "Money brings you happiness 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-24T09:26:15", "owner": "hamyay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081757870749301, "text": "沒關係越多人娶俄羅斯的越好 讓某群過剩 很棒", "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:24:10", "owner": "co.brian.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090967360698174, "text": "放開那女的讓我來😂", "created_at": "2025-09-20T00:13:07", "owner": "yu.tim0609", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949242967010024, "text": "@minemetsa_ could be us but you don’t wanna be happy", "created_at": "2025-09-18T07:13:19", "owner": "laikait", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921597823138385, "text": "男的是不是超级有钱", "created_at": "2025-09-17T09:27:19", "owner": "hyun_iriss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973652562779762, "text": "bro你去哪裡抓來的小烏烏", "created_at": "2025-09-16T14:54:23", "owner": "pecachill9453", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053966855536810, "text": "表情😁➡️😒", "created_at": "2025-09-16T12:14:33", "owner": "owen_lien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048864089311162, "text": "女生好漂亮 男生有拿手機", "created_at": "2025-09-15T16:42:42", "owner": "le_e_cocooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885799774363311, "text": "這是GTA哪一個模組求下載😂", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:12:20", "owner": "david07160716", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079020541986635, "text": "女的很漂亮 男的也有五官", "created_at": "2025-09-15T10:11:36", "owner": "_.ku3ch1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855881089518050, "text": "太酷啦", "created_at": "2025-09-15T04:57:09", "owner": "rosk_jen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18406861594119830, "text": "你 在 跟 我 開 什 麼 玩 笑", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:13:13", "owner": "kz.x3x3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017681156770394, "text": "哥們～可以告訴我是哪一家賣場嗎🙃", "created_at": "2025-09-14T16:47:14", "owner": "jim0522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070760998934613, "text": "@birdkingfan @power2324", "created_at": "2025-09-14T14:38:20", "owner": "wwsyg3362", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035627243489311, "text": "\"Look what I pulled\"", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:41:53", "owner": "dad.bod.jumps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409884445115677, "text": "他生我夢", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:47:45", "owner": "yang920428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994409433683816, "text": "77777", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:04:56", "owner": "goldgirl0512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940726996063236, "text": "很明顯你扛不起她，讓我試試看", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:52:58", "owner": "dengshih27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042536930666502, "text": "@liao.0127 輸在哪", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:49:06", "owner": "wakamado_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202951351309746, "text": "AI", "created_at": "2025-09-12T23:06:57", "owner": "parkbroom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293513992282692, "text": "嗯……有錢的形容詞就是這麼形容的吧", "created_at": "2025-09-12T12:20:07", "owner": "ranam_0415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090101032793593, "text": "兄弟突然覺得你過分了😢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T02:54:42", "owner": "a851091234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072721352153648, "text": "人生還是得學會賺錢🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-11T19:25:56", "owner": "1107.ho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015565109598128, "text": "草泥馬的", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:30:48", "owner": "joshl0225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071613062175511, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T15:33:35", "owner": "logg.000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912019309069209, "text": "你他妈的。。。。。", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:40:04", "owner": "anima_l0919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902628220124131, "text": "請問這是愛人如養花嗎？", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:57:23", "owner": "cy____6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033862790687082, "text": "女的五官緊緻，男的也還有呼吸", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:54:22", "owner": "yml_5x78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078908572803437, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-09T13:29:33", "owner": "wenjinboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895443949294653, "text": "各位晚上好！除了你以外", "created_at": "2025-09-08T15:34:27", "owner": "lin_moun_jay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083962522908771, "text": "大家晚上好 除了你", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:08:06", "owner": "orion_lhy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341115628164442, "text": "看到這個影片我有點擔心男生目前的安全🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:27:21", "owner": "klein_0611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398627002189988, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-08T05:11:11", "owner": "wwwyyy_0927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009340370794876, "text": "哥们别搞", "created_at": "2025-09-08T04:00:11", "owner": "wushi2901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937011277074888, "text": "凭什么", "created_at": "2025-09-04T04:08:53", "owner": "ph_159_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093126598732980, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:37:39", "owner": "zwjzwj0205_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910827622206140, "text": "好美😮", "created_at": "2025-09-03T12:33:03", "owner": "mr.simonjonathan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082784527916109, "text": "想說點什麼 但是算了 馬的幹", "created_at": "2025-09-03T03:00:32", "owner": "da.ryan0513", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17980636424909995, "text": "就我一个人发现对面有yonex的专卖店吗🌚", "created_at": "2025-09-02T12:42:45", "owner": "marcus325_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066372742994368, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-01T14:20:21", "owner": "jacey.eu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316655998208484, "text": "請跟我說這是AI拜託", "created_at": "2025-09-01T12:48:51", "owner": "0914hacker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858320497489157, "text": "臨演多少錢😂", "created_at": "2025-09-01T11:11:12", "owner": "shiau_yue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138566179425886, "text": "女的超正 男的有穿衣服", "created_at": "2025-08-31T21:52:20", "owner": "pei___030712", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907668085090511, "text": "我看你女朋友缺女友\n要不就我來當👁️👄👁️", "created_at": "2025-08-31T10:41:52", "owner": "7_xa.ne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076234184073366, "text": "買來的吧？", "created_at": "2025-08-31T01:55:13", "owner": "195__84_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078053537313665, "text": "대단한 능력이다 어떻게 저런 여자를? 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-08-31T01:14:30", "owner": "pink_production2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099199279529563, "text": "@pp89324 留言超好笑😆", "created_at": "2025-08-30T15:45:12", "owner": "___yaqi___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036918209480111, "text": "不是 哥們 你褲子很歪", "created_at": "2025-08-30T12:32:37", "owner": "yuxuan_419", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110274823532742, "text": "拼現金", "created_at": "2025-08-30T11:14:57", "owner": "_russell.666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037290653465284, "text": "兄弟 你贏了", "created_at": "2025-08-30T02:19:07", "owner": "ken._188", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044626979334482, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-08-30T01:48:41", "owner": "happyw1011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035001410698148, "text": "哥是不是有鈔能力🥹", "created_at": "2025-08-29T20:16:14", "owner": "bamboo.lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943376305023705, "text": "揪團去白俄羅斯有人要一起嗎？", "created_at": "2025-08-29T17:25:29", "owner": "lokinge_45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968437326933838, "text": "男友基礎女友就不基礎", "created_at": "2025-08-29T14:07:12", "owner": "wu_minsyuan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18147009097407973, "text": "女生好美😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-08-29T08:28:39", "owner": "qiu_room", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087107239665653, "text": "男生基礎 女生就不基礎", "created_at": "2025-08-29T08:16:15", "owner": "wild_chang1230", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085458247864827, "text": "這是娶了個模特兒回家啊", "created_at": "2025-08-29T05:32:56", "owner": "0701_hyp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936584434060774, "text": "我的兄弟们 牙痒痒 你真是该死啊", "created_at": "2025-08-28T18:30:14", "owner": "wdnmd3ool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069012805909133, "text": "哥，你的幸福吵到我了😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:14:01", "owner": "dihokorilee_1108", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065827835227123, "text": "99 兄弟", "created_at": "2025-08-28T11:29:23", "owner": "bingganz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320692153234144, "text": "太瘦了", "created_at": "2025-08-28T11:12:53", "owner": "1113.dd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154675729381432, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-28T03:37:58", "owner": "amigiga_chad", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17870563125424424, "text": "他怎麼拐到的教我", "created_at": "2025-08-27T19:16:10", "owner": "jo_05_21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18522458047034456, "text": "🖕🏻🖕🏻🖕🏻🖕🏻", "created_at": "2025-08-27T16:33:09", "owner": "yinzz95_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083091022911299, "text": "是不是給人家下藥了", "created_at": "2025-08-27T16:23:12", "owner": "thunderchen_12288", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090607507706301, "text": "救過他全家？💀", "created_at": "2025-08-27T16:17:10", "owner": "koyunayi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905156239234442, "text": "鈔能力 🧐", "created_at": "2025-08-27T13:39:57", "owner": "st91343st91343", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079747834920529, "text": "俄羅斯？", "created_at": "2025-08-27T09:15:57", "owner": "chun_0925_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050230757631166, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-08-27T07:31:25", "owner": "o11o.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067634612463088, "text": "女的很漂亮，男的有穿衣服", "created_at": "2025-08-27T07:28:30", "owner": "yc._.2068", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055621076160385, "text": "AI?", "created_at": "2025-08-27T07:12:53", "owner": "darrenlin378", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087250375802731, "text": "我以為妳要變裝…", "created_at": "2025-08-27T05:42:10", "owner": "miracle_skin7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891833803311738, "text": "不是哥，那麼久沒見，吃上那麼好了？", "created_at": "2025-08-27T05:10:10", "owner": "_k_0607_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052780091540109, "text": "已檢舉", "created_at": "2025-08-27T02:36:44", "owner": "owen048106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892089571180825, "text": "兄弟需要帮忙吗", "created_at": "2025-08-27T00:43:43", "owner": "wilson_coming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398402269190192, "text": "@shi_hsiu", "created_at": "2025-08-26T18:37:04", "owner": "dayulin1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094433356636527, "text": "I heard that if you had a sense of humour you can pull a baddie but this is too much even if he was making walls laugh it's still impossible", "created_at": "2025-08-26T17:51:44", "owner": "goussama270", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906865711217722, "text": "你就逛uniqulo, 但女的卻提著Chanel的包😏", "created_at": "2025-08-26T15:33:35", "owner": "kay.ks.chan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095054143650796, "text": "哥布林在此表示我看了很不舒服😢", "created_at": "2025-08-26T15:21:50", "owner": "0829_howard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091938655672091, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-26T13:15:55", "owner": "kami_.0831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081151357923890, "text": "Omg!She is so beautiful……!🥰\nDoes she has her own profile?", "created_at": "2025-08-26T00:31:38", "owner": "dovletino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037440497459337, "text": "존나이쁘네", "created_at": "2025-08-24T11:16:29", "owner": "jijonghyeon6795", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076106294510232, "text": "@biengraciasxoxo 網友留言太好笑了吧", "created_at": "2025-08-24T03:04:38", "owner": "z.andre_an12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869256025425659, "text": "我輸在哪", "created_at": "2025-08-23T14:52:57", "owner": "6.v3_her", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053650493390884, "text": "怎麼看起來像黑羽", "created_at": "2025-08-22T17:51:28", "owner": "jung.jung1101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073413500482061, "text": "6", "created_at": "2025-08-22T17:45:21", "owner": "xxs_0416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154933930377266, "text": "哥們過程能出書嗎", "created_at": "2025-08-22T17:00:03", "owner": "wc._.07_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073059683282737, "text": "兄弟 我們女友出租沒附錄影功能喔 要加錢", "created_at": "2025-08-22T14:18:23", "owner": "wei_20000513", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023494412726921, "text": "我第一眼沒看到任何東西，除了yonex", "created_at": "2025-08-22T14:11:30", "owner": "azub23uuubbb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880582498258138, "text": "哇靠 哇哇哇", "created_at": "2025-08-22T14:08:56", "owner": "susu1270_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094808737575390, "text": "就是中國跟俄羅斯很近 滿滿的機會", "created_at": "2025-08-22T13:04:31", "owner": "jason790924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191736319317385, "text": "不公平，真的超級不公平，我沒有破防", "created_at": "2025-08-22T11:26:14", "owner": "mo_z_arifin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079660781502271, "text": "不是億萬富翁就是上輩子拯救過地球", "created_at": "2025-08-22T09:37:39", "owner": "robinlwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073777148086047, "text": "兄弟，她配不上你，只配得上我😂", "created_at": "2025-08-22T07:25:23", "owner": "su.luuuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931261101963634, "text": "為什麼？", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:13:33", "owner": "wsl_bossun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036586577462014, "text": "绝美 绝配😭😭", "created_at": "2025-08-21T13:40:34", "owner": "lyx_621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913525687177915, "text": "Some men winning in life?? How niceee", "created_at": "2025-08-21T07:55:28", "owner": "irei266", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185626108325473, "text": "兄弟，放開她，你扶不穩，讓我來", "created_at": "2025-08-21T07:47:14", "owner": "xxkotp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154618573346093, "text": "你真该死啊兄弟", "created_at": "2025-08-21T05:51:20", "owner": "yk_.05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943653478042790, "text": "凭什么？凭什么？😭凭什么？😭", "created_at": "2025-08-21T01:38:40", "owner": "karirikaawo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874817875402815, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-21T00:22:58", "owner": "hc01._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891055666304230, "text": "破防", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:25:38", "owner": "johnnystaychill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918241177152435, "text": "她好美 超扯...", "created_at": "2025-08-20T16:34:04", "owner": "bloody_606", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18234480361292026, "text": "没胸没屁股，我一点都不羡慕 🤧。。。。就不！😭", "created_at": "2025-08-20T16:00:14", "owner": "eason.105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125691946466135, "text": "女生好美😍", "created_at": "2025-08-20T14:19:19", "owner": "fishsaceme0731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086597287630928, "text": "No way …….", "created_at": "2025-08-20T14:06:44", "owner": "eoseono", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905422138237239, "text": "冇預計到會突然間中閃光彈😭", "created_at": "2025-08-20T13:46:10", "owner": "kronos0217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106950946557576, "text": "兄弟 方便問一下上輩子燒什麼牌子的香嗎？", "created_at": "2025-08-20T12:58:32", "owner": "hao_______chen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17846573115550163, "text": "你是你女友在LV店前面撿到的嗎？", "created_at": "2025-08-20T12:33:47", "owner": "duckbubi_0911", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18398802358140901, "text": "告訴我 什麼睡姿", "created_at": "2025-08-20T11:51:39", "owner": "4hyhci", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056065682616479, "text": "請問要什麼枕頭才能夢到呢", "created_at": "2025-08-20T11:47:28", "owner": "zero22037", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061043144594752, "text": "你打擾到我了", "created_at": "2025-08-20T10:57:05", "owner": "hao_890103", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072107129089846, "text": "拉出来直接眼前一亮", "created_at": "2025-08-20T10:48:27", "owner": "125_owo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851317816485157, "text": "你的幸福打擾到我了", "created_at": "2025-08-20T09:36:19", "owner": "l._.427", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995983062668314, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-20T06:07:45", "owner": "lemangslayer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068461649150153, "text": "😡", "created_at": "2025-08-20T04:47:34", "owner": "magisean_0724", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089317018739555, "text": "不是哥们。", "created_at": "2025-08-20T04:30:10", "owner": "_ih.ate.4am_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037566620442950, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-20T03:05:25", "owner": "spideeer___exee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935878522064899, "text": "This song is SO GOOD", "created_at": "2025-08-19T22:38:15", "owner": "maria_huahsiaoyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896956594144673, "text": "Que changados estoy haciendo mal?", "created_at": "2025-08-19T21:50:03", "owner": "atlasdia5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336333403205546, "text": "我服了", "created_at": "2025-08-19T20:54:24", "owner": "lisyyywhyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876564565285787, "text": "兄弟我決定出山洞了 精靈在哪！", "created_at": "2025-08-19T14:05:22", "owner": "h_uang_0922", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17932106694082481, "text": "输了你，赢了世界又如何？", "created_at": "2025-08-19T12:51:54", "owner": "ngjayyeah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525597781007316, "text": "@liuyanhanl 我輸在哪", "created_at": "2025-08-19T10:56:23", "owner": "jeyytg_35542", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063367082018011, "text": "你他媽", "created_at": "2025-08-19T10:39:32", "owner": "tim__1114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075798991990796, "text": "吃那麽好，太傷人了", "created_at": "2025-08-19T09:14:26", "owner": "chrisfkt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090153937686211, "text": "怕兄弟吃不饱 又怕兄弟吃太好", "created_at": "2025-08-19T04:46:55", "owner": "jasonk_1301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049979249245767, "text": "好希望你也敗在紅姐的石榴裙下🥲", "created_at": "2025-08-19T01:23:16", "owner": "lee11._.13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18370432075177378, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-18T17:20:08", "owner": "thegreatestshowoncourt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889899625304250, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-18T17:20:07", "owner": "thegreatestshowoncourt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842001976562764, "text": "@0_xuanyuan_0 😧", "created_at": "2025-08-18T16:49:53", "owner": "nu5.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124423567467559, "text": "靠我一女的都要心動了，不可以把精靈拐回家🥲", "created_at": "2025-08-18T14:54:36", "owner": "victoria._.0519", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17866887630432542, "text": "给兄弟们指条路，东欧夜店一群这样质量的女孩，还不用给她们买香奈儿的包😂", "created_at": "2025-08-18T14:22:04", "owner": "md_inparis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17872900698408813, "text": "哥布林不要被精靈騙了🙃", "created_at": "2025-08-18T13:17:32", "owner": "qguorui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976162221877286, "text": "@qimin_0619 AI", "created_at": "2025-08-18T12:10:23", "owner": "0216._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085207786833459, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-18T11:24:09", "owner": "16cmdick_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083077153902926, "text": "又是你、昨天在微信刷个给😂", "created_at": "2025-08-18T10:31:50", "owner": "hojaiyi5203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075341896963863, "text": "怕兄弟吃不好 又怕兄弟吃太好", "created_at": "2025-08-18T10:16:10", "owner": "andy_huang.419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980889279735210, "text": "女生很漂亮 男生也有穿衣服", "created_at": "2025-08-18T09:39:59", "owner": "shao_2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161335279375019, "text": "哪一間uq有附贈這種正妹？", "created_at": "2025-08-18T09:18:03", "owner": "_rsyamn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380959708135153, "text": "我沒了", "created_at": "2025-08-18T09:10:33", "owner": "8e5.98c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843493366557298, "text": "蛤 要確欸 手一伸就有這樣的 哪裡在Uniqlo嗎", "created_at": "2025-08-18T08:34:14", "owner": "hongshihong19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068515876923806, "text": "期待你被車撞死", "created_at": "2025-08-18T06:17:16", "owner": "cbzqjbczs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070668818164173, "text": "你好扯", "created_at": "2025-08-17T23:17:08", "owner": "fuck_.0331", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072102422027581, "text": "各位不要看了我們只拉得到空氣", "created_at": "2025-08-17T22:41:53", "owner": "eric__0518", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094200967645659, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-08-17T22:31:16", "owner": "tammy8200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333966640201972, "text": "哪一間可以框這種的", "created_at": "2025-08-17T21:48:59", "owner": "kevin.08_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184445683325346, "text": "太犯規了！！！！", "created_at": "2025-08-17T19:07:08", "owner": "adolph_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953040183995307, "text": "越看越難過😢", "created_at": "2025-08-17T18:36:28", "owner": "math57946", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984220908715390, "text": "me and who", "created_at": "2025-08-17T17:46:50", "owner": "catiecat2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148586491392531, "text": "哥們刪了吧", "created_at": "2025-08-17T17:03:23", "owner": "jingxuns", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18478936861072369, "text": "你去哪找的精靈？", "created_at": "2025-08-17T13:40:56", "owner": "chang_an183", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040519580382326, "text": "哇靠哇靠 美女姐姐 這個臉 這個腿 啊啊啊啊啊😍😍", "created_at": "2025-08-17T13:18:40", "owner": "tny._.soyeon_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368617054151864, "text": "太漂亮了吧😍阿你可以跟他配一下嗎不要這麼做自己哈哈哈哈哈🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-17T12:29:29", "owner": "alyl904", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988372155837837, "text": "可以举报吗？😂", "created_at": "2025-08-17T09:56:42", "owner": "krauser.yuas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18403113727118086, "text": "這是歐系車嗎？", "created_at": "2025-08-17T09:15:36", "owner": "annmeow0103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100466497522219, "text": "@heibai820118  回山洞囉", "created_at": "2025-08-17T09:15:31", "owner": "kai_0918i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037798784405801, "text": "上帝男", "created_at": "2025-08-17T07:42:44", "owner": "yoan_1108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059169116377718, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-17T06:23:57", "owner": "_7xou.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977079558908895, "text": "這種精靈在哪裡抓？ 用什麼球抓？", "created_at": "2025-08-17T02:21:36", "owner": "chansiuming9527", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17976925373751053, "text": "我了个逗，为什么美女都喜欢没自己好看的男人，我恨自己不是男人", "created_at": "2025-08-16T20:43:22", "owner": "ka_trina7950", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074508247832916, "text": "pass", "created_at": "2025-08-16T19:15:21", "owner": "h3ndo.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048458918259141, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-16T19:01:07", "owner": "oscarnvmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900507622123172, "text": "沒人告訴你不可以拍這種嗎？會攻擊到我", "created_at": "2025-08-16T17:53:16", "owner": "pj._.1102", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17856262008490636, "text": "Ai罷了", "created_at": "2025-08-16T17:03:01", "owner": "konodioda_dada", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054665411413655, "text": "美女妳適合更好的🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2025-08-16T15:26:33", "owner": "olivia____1128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976783806751272, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-16T15:14:16", "owner": "zk7cr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041028686354502, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-08-16T14:52:53", "owner": "hyj._.0715", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055047224529607, "text": "輸在哪？？？？？", "created_at": "2025-08-16T11:18:01", "owner": "wnnzh__jjk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944689410902124, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-16T09:31:08", "owner": "00_williamk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037110992447689, "text": "응?", "created_at": "2025-08-16T09:16:56", "owner": "jw_han_78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054710132622491, "text": "操這是怎樣啊", "created_at": "2025-08-16T08:10:25", "owner": "h.c.c2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868643464425977, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-16T07:34:51", "owner": "amarboldby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122459782482715, "text": "好美(*´◒`*)", "created_at": "2025-08-16T05:29:22", "owner": "__mari.0228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523166755050752, "text": "你小子為什麼吃這麼好，給我吃一口", "created_at": "2025-08-16T04:22:39", "owner": "zihan_63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294470935269414, "text": "@0622_taiyou", "created_at": "2025-08-16T02:11:22", "owner": "ca_xx5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075975004952038, "text": "喔痛苦", "created_at": "2025-08-16T01:42:31", "owner": "xmz_171717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095203387651848, "text": "哭死", "created_at": "2025-08-16T00:28:49", "owner": "azusavan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842032042561371, "text": "面子滿分了😂，還有，這首歌讚啦！", "created_at": "2025-08-15T20:46:59", "owner": "weiching1986", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17905993920235212, "text": "أما مزه بشكل 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-15T20:18:39", "owner": "roro_retaj301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519642532014451, "text": "UQ:什麼意思", "created_at": "2025-08-15T17:50:33", "owner": "david_jhong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921965899128454, "text": "不要這麼高調，有點吵到我的孤單寂寞了", "created_at": "2025-08-15T17:06:27", "owner": "cherry99082023", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18116365642500584, "text": "他凭什么(´･_･`)", "created_at": "2025-08-15T16:22:50", "owner": "chong_3x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084069442883052, "text": "And I’m single? Wtf", "created_at": "2025-08-15T15:58:32", "owner": "smaxkdaddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519730564055149, "text": "兄弟  你這輩子也算幸福了", "created_at": "2025-08-15T15:43:26", "owner": "cy_.0002", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049557725265702, "text": "$$$$$$$$$ gross", "created_at": "2025-08-15T15:42:53", "owner": "whatever_whatevs00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045234260323533, "text": "你們的幸福沒打擾到我但打擊到了", "created_at": "2025-08-15T14:49:48", "owner": "cby._.313", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863689090449129, "text": "有時候祝福只是嘴上說說，不太希望成真", "created_at": "2025-08-15T14:07:14", "owner": "linuok9", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17876232393288751, "text": "上輩子救了一個世界嗎", "created_at": "2025-08-15T13:29:39", "owner": "lide502", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17926110294099625, "text": "WHY! Tell me!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-08-15T13:13:05", "owner": "yyc._.0111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890315875314135, "text": "下面那紅點是我的鼻子嗎？🤡", "created_at": "2025-08-15T12:59:29", "owner": "lienlin927", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035525927679974, "text": "叫你吃點好的 誰叫你吃這麼好", "created_at": "2025-08-15T11:38:35", "owner": "lokguo777", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18071591939118489, "text": "嗚嗚嗚嗚", "created_at": "2025-08-15T11:31:27", "owner": "jackyjacky_hei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076829048149311, "text": "這是真的嗎？", "created_at": "2025-08-15T10:26:37", "owner": "ooodovobooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950027832876765, "text": "Still like a man", "created_at": "2025-08-15T09:58:53", "owner": "zxc08954301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892433914298675, "text": "原諒我在那一瞬間噴出了髒話", "created_at": "2025-08-15T08:46:22", "owner": "_yk0314", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042117128352441, "text": "Spotlight的歌詞", "created_at": "2025-08-15T06:20:51", "owner": "n_bw___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084340951882764, "text": "鏡中月 水中花", "created_at": "2025-08-15T06:14:38", "owner": "yuting4076", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075147628956320, "text": "這樣會沒朋友的", "created_at": "2025-08-15T04:52:53", "owner": "machuga_yy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365658664146346, "text": "走了，不玩了", "created_at": "2025-08-15T04:18:27", "owner": "lidahei96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922133668121332, "text": "原本期待變裝的微笑瞬間塌了，真的是謝謝你，兄弟。", "created_at": "2025-08-15T02:43:21", "owner": "v.o.n._.0402", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17968849973929330, "text": "沃草⋯⋯⋯上輩子你一定是英雄", "created_at": "2025-08-14T22:14:20", "owner": "peter00268", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18134338018441474, "text": "上輩子拯救過地球？😮", "created_at": "2025-08-14T21:38:43", "owner": "xxx369258147s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062095703042421, "text": "兄弟你上輩子燒的是什麼香", "created_at": "2025-08-14T18:09:33", "owner": "juanwei.1995", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17953661424004418, "text": "我輸了", "created_at": "2025-08-14T16:01:27", "owner": "timeisthemotherfucker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108838486536003, "text": "不准你這麼自私", "created_at": "2025-08-14T14:47:49", "owner": "mwactionature", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940309536918062, "text": "這傢伙一定是冒險者", "created_at": "2025-08-14T14:46:42", "owner": "julian90mas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980939625728123, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-14T14:16:55", "owner": "yux.0817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097207045618748, "text": "最后可以麻烦你扶稳吗，人家都要跌到了😂", "created_at": "2025-08-14T14:13:10", "owner": "momojiaozi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18353718193086687, "text": "？牛逼", "created_at": "2025-08-14T13:22:02", "owner": "xuen.ovo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071772569040103, "text": "說吧！你花了多少錢她願意配合演出", "created_at": "2025-08-14T13:20:18", "owner": "candice_7700", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069536573515038, "text": "反正玩完就膩了，到時候還不是想換本土妹玩玩", "created_at": "2025-08-14T12:14:49", "owner": "dodofar_666", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17964581237948746, "text": "唉西八", "created_at": "2025-08-14T11:34:59", "owner": "dongbei_1031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087278812701937, "text": "你妈的", "created_at": "2025-08-14T11:22:37", "owner": "ngu903_888", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969672600931374, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-14T10:29:23", "owner": "darrennn_54", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17846479437526281, "text": "第一次想刀人", "created_at": "2025-08-14T10:12:43", "owner": "cck.zhang", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047900777284381, "text": "不是哥們", "created_at": "2025-08-14T08:49:29", "owner": "qin_shi_huang1229", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088035457702104, "text": "來自成都的他", "created_at": "2025-08-14T04:11:36", "owner": "ccf_7.27", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917575924117765, "text": "沃草", "created_at": "2025-08-13T19:13:57", "owner": "jackalliu812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18279629311286944, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-13T17:07:04", "owner": "ka1w3n0806", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086314621762415, "text": "憑甚麼", "created_at": "2025-08-13T16:42:01", "owner": "fkwkxke.11234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052432097193683, "text": "跌倒都不用扶 太酷了", "created_at": "2025-08-13T13:53:41", "owner": "luffy_930315", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843016378554538, "text": "@alexchen0812 @s9105600", "created_at": "2025-08-13T13:43:15", "owner": "condenses_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944809329897854, "text": "女生好漂亮歐😍", "created_at": "2025-08-13T13:27:24", "owner": "yuli_shih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053446712398250, "text": "能帮我拉一个？拉一个这样的出来你就是我兄弟", "created_at": "2025-08-13T10:54:34", "owner": "eddice_729", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18397117555138918, "text": "看著看著我笑了，\n笑著笑著我哭了。", "created_at": "2025-08-13T10:43:45", "owner": "ting._.xu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872777944406865, "text": "個like係比bgm", "created_at": "2025-08-13T08:41:22", "owner": "longchan_198", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076472854979549, "text": "看完的一瞬間 手機不小心飛出去了", "created_at": "2025-08-13T07:59:26", "owner": "zhx._.27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038077676673650, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-08-13T07:46:35", "owner": "zaxsc2333_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172308901348995, "text": "不要這樣 發點別的吧", "created_at": "2025-08-13T06:55:50", "owner": "__ying05_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103251022505421, "text": "When u pull at 10/10 by being funny", "created_at": "2025-08-13T06:19:55", "owner": "cheeyinity_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849372742535706, "text": "我到底書輸在哪😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-08-13T05:04:28", "owner": "jeff_lin0821", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994809435818238, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-13T03:55:22", "owner": "rich8crazy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088280221757441, "text": "好漂亮喔！！！", "created_at": "2025-08-13T01:15:34", "owner": "158.0_w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031077833650814, "text": "😂😂兄弟我要看你们穿婚礼服😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T23:49:05", "owner": "_jiahuat_8280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039226253383616, "text": "哥們你上輩子救了地球嗎", "created_at": "2025-08-12T21:41:43", "owner": "c_p_xx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991439640683022, "text": "抖音原片的留言下，最多人按愛心是這麼說的：她看起來是雅詩蘭黛，你像一元店XDDDDD超級好笑", "created_at": "2025-08-12T21:28:23", "owner": "tian___915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918025363147398, "text": "她不愛錢，但要讓她感動的每個瞬間都要花錢！", "created_at": "2025-08-12T18:57:27", "owner": "see.you__tomorrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106657324558361, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-12T18:49:58", "owner": "elena.molyar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072792224007456, "text": "大陸扒仔溝桑拿雞妹= 窮屌屌免費雞", "created_at": "2025-08-12T18:15:18", "owner": "_69iam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920293174133439, "text": "媽的.....你可以找美女我都沒問題，竟然找金絲貓😤", "created_at": "2025-08-12T17:49:32", "owner": "fedandsi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875988871288815, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-12T17:28:40", "owner": "iron3617398525", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175883386339614, "text": "美到不真實", "created_at": "2025-08-12T16:50:51", "owner": "jimomo.snkr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008123153788188, "text": "不是 哥們 嫉妒使我面目全非", "created_at": "2025-08-12T16:18:27", "owner": "3.1415926_0101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050320133227317, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-12T15:44:49", "owner": "kelza_erka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855971773484144, "text": "你只有一個工作 不要讓她跌倒！", "created_at": "2025-08-12T15:26:53", "owner": "leonmade2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905960791228111, "text": "一瞬間我就不嘻嘻了", "created_at": "2025-08-12T15:00:45", "owner": "goldyubrain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132336370448210, "text": "我的鼻子怎么落在镜子上了", "created_at": "2025-08-12T14:30:50", "owner": "mob_tchau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918888289117007, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-08-12T14:30:06", "owner": "bb393393", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080114608908075, "text": "How did you even pull her 👀", "created_at": "2025-08-12T14:19:14", "owner": "lm__sean", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18076553815980615, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-12T13:49:03", "owner": "amberboy914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083506477859127, "text": "你們要不要自己去開一間優衣庫？", "created_at": "2025-08-12T13:24:49", "owner": "hopely7561", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941448430028882, "text": "好像芭比娃娃😀", "created_at": "2025-08-12T13:24:06", "owner": "cz._.0930", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855162949447359, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-12T13:07:25", "owner": "debbieee_cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846320665524317, "text": "拍完了就各回各家", "created_at": "2025-08-12T12:57:43", "owner": "xie.qianyun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959097774968465, "text": "@lanxing__", "created_at": "2025-08-12T12:18:17", "owner": "intriguing_self", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102250348519276, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-12T11:53:50", "owner": "mc_miix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948480807882823, "text": "原本以為要拿紅點對準鼻子", "created_at": "2025-08-12T11:03:29", "owner": "yzin_108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367332781149586, "text": "我覺得吧我這個人肯定是輸在沒他有內容", "created_at": "2025-08-12T10:46:34", "owner": "tollby_is_me", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063386066237677, "text": "好權威的臉..", "created_at": "2025-08-12T10:35:31", "owner": "iamashnoly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043997609327227, "text": "@ohmyshape9527 @_tingwei326", "created_at": "2025-08-12T09:49:09", "owner": "_______________________youming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043815545331513, "text": "偶买噶", "created_at": "2025-08-12T09:47:13", "owner": "erpan_ski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035839250673273, "text": "很明顯最後你把握不住她", "created_at": "2025-08-12T09:35:41", "owner": "qazxsw791022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075689876054903, "text": "天公北…….犯規了", "created_at": "2025-08-12T07:19:07", "owner": "hain.tang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098065987529734, "text": "金髮閉眼", "created_at": "2025-08-12T06:10:37", "owner": "_ruah_w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170418085355484, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-12T05:03:15", "owner": "wh_y326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914125975168769, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-12T04:34:49", "owner": "jo_nas.rl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085100368831618, "text": "對面有yy🤩", "created_at": "2025-08-12T04:06:40", "owner": "loyinkiu3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044457344329527, "text": "怎麼樣可以認識這麼美的風景", "created_at": "2025-08-12T02:21:13", "owner": "_hong.02.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036113165444741, "text": "來的時候我以為AI如此看不出瑕疵", "created_at": "2025-08-11T16:40:34", "owner": "bethting10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117353716497048, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-11T14:08:26", "owner": "huoye._.0805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900705985248895, "text": "@chang_0522 兄弟我相信你值得比這位老兄更好的", "created_at": "2025-08-11T13:47:01", "owner": "co_be_543", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18282020287258936, "text": "快放開他。精靈都會騙人", "created_at": "2025-08-11T13:24:29", "owner": "____ahua62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012981269772951, "text": "鈔能力💴", "created_at": "2025-08-11T12:52:05", "owner": "mickeyi1225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851295493479492, "text": "不是，鏡子上是誰的小丑鼻子掉了？ 哦..沒事 是我的🤡", "created_at": "2025-08-11T10:51:08", "owner": "shixian1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108996982532520, "text": "我先檢舉色情", "created_at": "2025-08-11T09:33:26", "owner": "hys___0717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055118921415673, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-08-11T05:54:41", "owner": "_sun.731_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075418982494464, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-08-11T05:11:22", "owner": "serena.beams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085993552834618, "text": "螺絲", "created_at": "2025-08-11T04:02:41", "owner": "by___0115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047721026637425, "text": "你真该死啊", "created_at": "2025-08-11T02:27:43", "owner": "_cerebrum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930704758084329, "text": "ref do something", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:47:09", "owner": "leoo_jin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097107436626909, "text": "先吃我一記檢舉", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:29:22", "owner": "eison109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18231808405289887, "text": "这部电影好好看", "created_at": "2025-08-10T14:14:40", "owner": "gabriel__leong", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068224726935490, "text": "🏚️", "created_at": "2025-08-10T12:02:20", "owner": "ai_chen_o4.o9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901537069236444, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-10T11:06:22", "owner": "solarasc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184590115322651, "text": "@maxwellhuangg 大 G wagon", "created_at": "2025-08-10T10:20:47", "owner": "lekuanjames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179012986336794, "text": "恨帥潮", "created_at": "2025-08-10T09:31:16", "owner": "ffgea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521691157013781, "text": "我不只羨慕還嫉妒😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T08:43:20", "owner": "cancer.2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099641620608323, "text": "你們的幸福打擾到我了", "created_at": "2025-08-10T07:46:59", "owner": "kbryan12345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030529208499258, "text": "妳的幸福吵到我了😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T07:09:13", "owner": "weii_2705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989445543828279, "text": "兄弟你太壞了唷", "created_at": "2025-08-10T05:49:42", "owner": "yingrueidong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036305171438640, "text": "18號  讓她生", "created_at": "2025-08-10T04:28:06", "owner": "rice.eat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890689906180852, "text": "兄弟你上輩子拯救過地球？", "created_at": "2025-08-10T04:01:15", "owner": "asssss9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868605466424361, "text": "什麼樣的枕頭可以做出這樣的夢？", "created_at": "2025-08-10T03:46:53", "owner": "songyan121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889727041304381, "text": "能学吗？", "created_at": "2025-08-10T01:24:21", "owner": "ty.daniele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088210144757451, "text": "🍏🍐🥬🥦🫑🫒🥗", "created_at": "2025-08-09T13:05:36", "owner": "__lcn__9879", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052361576435497, "text": "Holy", "created_at": "2025-08-09T11:06:01", "owner": "shin_shing_kwok_fu_shing", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074264699004560, "text": "..", "created_at": "2025-08-09T10:47:09", "owner": "sung_aidan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335572288167446, "text": "牛逼", "created_at": "2025-08-09T10:15:54", "owner": "gristr_andrew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065815949332580, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-08-09T08:20:00", "owner": "chiu._.1", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18371456071178650, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-08-09T08:13:05", "owner": "mr.feelgood____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064119536218548, "text": "不搭", "created_at": "2025-08-09T07:41:19", "owner": "james_chen1229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920810740129573, "text": "瘦到不行", "created_at": "2025-08-09T06:21:00", "owner": "tsaicaleb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889367986321358, "text": "你把這幾輩子存的好運 用在這裡？\n你之後只能轉世當果蠅了", "created_at": "2025-08-09T03:28:09", "owner": "_.william528", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18531066766049423, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-09T03:06:53", "owner